   1580  fa37							; ClearPFColumn — A = left-half col 0..19; LineCount ($84) = first row;
   1581  fa37							;   CollisionEndY = last row (inclusive). AND-clear that col's
   1582  fa37							;   PF bit in those rows only. Clobbers A/X/Y/Temp ($AD) — NO CollisionX
   1583  fa37							;   (plan 5.1: BombMarkWalls keeps its broken-wall count there across the
   1584  fa37							;   call). Same-bank rts tail: BombMarkWalls jsrs this directly; the old
